4
00:02:12.197 --> 00:02:13.202
I'm not on there.
Are you on it?

5
00:02:13.226 --> 00:02:14.226
No.

6
00:02:15.769 --> 00:02:17.335
No! There's no way...

7
00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.179
